# Release tooling. `.github/workflows/release.yml` sparse-checks the trusted
# copy of .github/scripts into this path, inside the workspace, BEFORE the build
# step runs. `go build` stamps vcs.modified into every binary it produces and
# counts untracked files as modified, so leaving this path tracked would make
# every published artifact report `+dirty` on a tree that is exactly the tag.
.release-tooling/

